  <section><div class="os-raise-familysupport">
  <para><link url="https://phet.colorado.edu/sims/html/area-model-algebra/latest/area-model-algebra_en.html?screens=1,2,3">Access the interactive simulator </link>to begin this project.</para>
</div>

<para>In this activity, whenever you see 💬, stop and share your responses with your partner. If you have different responses, try to come to a consensus.</para>

<para>For 1 - 8, use the following instructions.</para> 

<blockquote>Use the simulation screen labeled “Explore”. Note you can switch between simulation screens using the toolbar located below the area model.</blockquote>


<list class="os-raise-noindent" type="enumerated">
<para/><item>Explain what the red and blue sliders do to the outside of the rectangle. </item>
<para/><item>Explain what the red and blue sliders do to the inside of the rectangle.</item> 
<para/><item>Describe what changes and what doesn’t change when the red and blue sliders are moved. 💬</item>
<para>
